## Component Structure (Modules)

**Each module is self-contained.**

```
modules/inventory/
├── pages/
│   ├── MaterialListPage.tsx       # Page component
│   └── MaterialDetailPage.tsx
├── components/
│   ├── MaterialTable.tsx          # Domain components
│   ├── MaterialForm.tsx
│   └── __tests__/
│       ├── MaterialTable.test.tsx
│       └── MaterialForm.test.tsx
├── hooks/
│   ├── useMaterials.ts            # Custom hooks
│   ├── useMaterialForm.ts
│   └── __tests__/
│       └── useMaterials.test.ts
├── services/
│   └── materialApi.ts             # API client
└── types/
    └── material.types.ts          # Interfaces
```

